{"id":"1b031b14eaa95ea3","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set.md","title":"ZFC Ideal Positive Set","display":"df-zfc-ideal-positive-set — ZFC Ideal Positive Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set","58-df-zfc-ideal6-positive-set"],"display":"df-zfc-ideal-positive-set — ZFC Ideal Positive Set","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","[[58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set</span><span>58-df-zfc-ideal6-positive-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ideal-positive-set — ZFC Ideal Positive Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset.md\">58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,I,X \\in V\">\\(A,I,X \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land A\\notin I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land A\\notin I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S(X,I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S(X,I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Positivity is relative to an actual ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, not an arbitrary family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-ideal6-positive-set</code> is merged here; it used the same positive-set condition with reordered parameters.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,I,X \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S \\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ideal}(I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land A\\subseteq X\\land A\\notin I","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}positive\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcIdeal6PositiveSet}_S(X,I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{IdealPositiveSet}_S(A,I,X)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false}],"bytes":1126,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set.md|58-df-zfc-ideal-positive-set]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9","2b6b1d9eb78a2714"]}